Important security setup:
- Do not enable public registration for administrator accounts.
- Create administrator accounts through a trusted administrative process.
- Assign each administrator their school and role through a trusted database operation.
- Never expose the Supabase service-role key in React.
- Do not give ordinary school administrators permission to change their own role or school assignment.
The RLS policies above protect student and class access. We will also keep administrator provisioning restricted to trusted operations.
